classDiagram
    direction LR
    class AssistantService {
        +Respond(ctx, text, sessionID, requestID, now)
        +Store repository.Store
        +Interpreter Interpreter
        +Calendar calendar.Service
    }
    class Interpreter {
        <<interface>>
        +Interpret(ctx, text, now) Command
    }
    class Simple {
        +Provider SimpleProvider
        +Interpret(ctx, text, now) Command
        +InterpretOperation(ctx, text, context) Operation
    }
    class GigaChat {
        +ParseOperation(ctx, request, context) Operation
        +Close()
    }
    class CalendarService {
        +Store repository.Store
        +Location time.Location
        +Create(ctx, input, now)
        +Import(ctx, reader, name, now)
    }
    class Store {
        <<interface>>
        +Read(ctx, callback)
        +Write(ctx, callback)
    }
    class PostgresDatabase {
        +Read(ctx, callback)
        +Write(ctx, callback)
    }
    class Event {
        +ID int64
        +Kind EventKind
        +Title string
        +Date Date
        +StartTime TimeOfDay
        +Status Status
    }
    AssistantService --> Interpreter : использует
    Simple ..|> Interpreter
    Simple --> GigaChat : понимание речи
    AssistantService --> CalendarService : исполняет проверенную команду
    AssistantService --> Store : диалог и результат
    CalendarService --> Store
    PostgresDatabase ..|> Store
    CalendarService --> Event
